# Everything is excluded except the operator binary the Dockerfile
# COPYs. The Dockerfile parameterizes the cargo profile via
# CARGO_PROFILE, so every profile's copy of the binary is admitted
# here; a profile listed in the Dockerfile but not here fails at COPY
# with an empty context, which is exactly the .dockerignore-vs-COPY
# conflict WOR-2399 was about.
**
!target/
!target/release-fast/
!target/release-fast/sbproxy-k8s-operator
!target/release/
!target/release/sbproxy-k8s-operator
!target/debug/
!target/debug/sbproxy-k8s-operator
